# The next three tests assert thicknesses expressed in device pixels (a
# sub-device-pixel edge snapped up to one whole device pixel), while their
# references can only express them in layout units, which the emulated device
# pixel scale multiplies. So we only test them at a scale of 1.
scale(1.0) == line-decoration-thickness.yaml line-decoration-thickness-ref.yaml
scale(1.0) == border-thickness.yaml border-thickness-ref.yaml
scale(1.0) == border-even-thickness.yaml border-even-thickness-ref.yaml
